# Preprocessing & Dataset Indexing

WBCIC-SHU formal training entry is the existing external `eog_ecg_clean` `.npz` manifest. SHU 2022 is currently indexed read-only from EDF/MAT/events/metadata files under `/share/workspace2/moto_imagination/SHU`.

Preprocessing must be explicit: do not hide raw-to-npz conversion inside dataset `load()`. If SHU preprocessing is added later, write outputs inside this project, record manifest rows, and never write into `/share/workspace2/moto_imagination/SHU`.

Preserve tensor convention `[trials, channels, time]`; WBCIC target is `[200,58,1000]`, SHU target metadata is 32 channels at 250 Hz. Fit preprocessing/alignment parameters only on the appropriate train/source data unless a report explicitly declares an offline diagnostic use.
